{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crab Champions is a fast paced roguelike shooter. Travel solo or with friends across exotic islands defeating hordes of enemies, collecting loot and becoming as powerful as possible creating game breaking builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/Gameplay_01.gif?t=1742863966\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Run based: the fun of a looter shooter packed into intense 20-40 minute runs with the option to loop endlessly to survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth and responsive movement and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully crafted visuals with a focus on quality while maintaining high performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack made specifically for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenges to unlock cosmetic skins and put your skills to the test in Nightmare difficulty with modifiers to spice things up even further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or assemble a multiplayer squad: the game is balanced separately for different party sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice matters: each run presents you with different loot combinations, enemy types and tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo developed by the creator of Crab Rave \ud83e\udd80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No lootboxes, microtransactions or ANY additional purchases required- all content is available to unlock in game by playing<br>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHAOTIC FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/Snow.gif?t=1742863966\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARKOUR I